    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Call Box Office for Subscription | Regular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245 Accredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125 Student: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100  Youth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission A stylish journey through ragtime sparkle, symphonic splendour, and the luminous voices of early 20th-century brilliance. Conductor: Mélanie Léonard Guest artist: Daniel Clarke Bouchard, piano L’Époque d’or Un voyage tout en élégance, entre l’effervescence du ragtime, la splendeur de l’écriture symphonique et les voix éclatantes qui ont illuminé le début du XX e siècle. Program J Kander/arr Rcketts: Selections from \"Chicago\" (1975) G Gerswin: Lullaby for Strings (1919) F Price: Piano Concerto (1934) S Joplin: Maple Leaf Rag (1899) V Archer: Poem for Orchestra (1940) A Khachaturian: The Masquerade Suite (1941)"
      }
