        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Mon Oct 19, 2026 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Classical / Orchestra\n      \n\n\n      Adult $49.00 | Student $20.00 | Arts Workers/Indigenous Community $25.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  SNB: Golden Era\n        \n                  \n            Call Box Office for Subscription |\nRegular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245\nAccredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125\nStudent: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100 \nYouth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission\nA stylish journey through ragtime sparkle, symphonic splendour, and the luminous voices\nof early 20th-century brilliance.\nConductor: Mélanie Léonard\nGuest artist: Daniel Clarke Bouchard, piano\nL’Époque d’or\nUn voyage tout en élégance, entre l’effervescence du ragtime, la splendeur de l’écriture\nsymphonique et les voix éclatantes qui ont illuminé le début du XX e siècle.\nProgram\nJ Kander/arr Rcketts: Selections from \"Chicago\" (1975)\nG Gerswin: Lullaby for Strings (1919)\nF Price: Piano Concerto (1934)\nS Joplin: Maple Leaf Rag (1899)\nV Archer: Poem for Orchestra (1940)\nA Khachaturian: The Masquerade Suite (1941)\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Classical / Orchestra      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snb-golden-era/47401AKQNQDVQMQKDSCQGTCTQNHNCHLHR/#event-47401akqnqdvqmqkdscqgtctqnhnchlhr\",\n    \"name\": \"SNB: Golden Era\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snb-golden-era/47401AKQNQDVQMQKDSCQGTCTQNHNCHLHR/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Call Box Office for Subscription | Regular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245 Accredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125 Student: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100  Youth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission A stylish journey through ragtime sparkle, symphonic splendour, and the luminous voices of early 20th-century brilliance. Conductor: Mélanie Léonard Guest artist: Daniel Clarke Bouchard, piano L’Époque d’or Un voyage tout en élégance, entre l’effervescence du ragtime, la splendeur de l’écriture symphonique et les voix éclatantes qui ont illuminé le début du XX e siècle. Program J Kander/arr Rcketts: Selections from \\\"Chicago\\\" (1975) G Gerswin: Lullaby for Strings (1919) F Price: Piano Concerto (1934) S Joplin: Maple Leaf Rag (1899) V Archer: Poem for Orchestra (1940) A Khachaturian: The Masquerade Suite (1941)\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/e40a1452-30f6-48e1-9c77-eb815263c81e.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-10-19T16:30:00-03:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=47401AKQNQDVQMQKDSCQGTCTQNHNCHLHR\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2026-10-19T16:30:00-03:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"SNB: Golden Era\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t"
