        "@value": "$12.50 //Rating: PG-13 | Country: Japan | Languages: Japanese [English subtitles] Year: 2025 // Genki Kawamura’s Dante-inspired spin on Kotake Create’s cult game traps Arashi star Kazunari Ninomiya in a looping, sterile subway where one mistake resets everything. A purgatorial thriller born from on-set collaboration, Exit 8 fuses gameplay logic with razor-sharp, emotionally charged cinema."
