        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Price Level One $79 || Price Level Two $69 || Price Level Three $59 || Student $49 || Groups of 8 or more get 25% off || \"RELIVE THE MUSIC\" is now even better as we’ve cranked it up a notch by adding the biggest hits of 70s ROCK, DISCO & FUNK. We still keep the biggest, most popular hits of the 50s & 60s, but have added our favourite 70s Artists."
