    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Admission $50 || Step into the magical world of Alebrijes, where imagination comes to life through vibrant dance, music, visual art, and storytelling. Inspired by the iconic creatures of Mexican folk art, this original multidisciplinary production celebrates creativity, cultural connection, and the power of imagination. Presented as part of the Dia d lose Muertos Atlantic Canada Festival, Alebrijes invites audiences of all ages on a colourful journey where tradition and fantasy come together in a joyful celebration of art, culture and community."
      }
    ],
