      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Sun Nov 1, 2026 • 5:00pm\n\n  \n          Dance\n    \n          Presentation\n      \n\n  Event length: 90 minutes\n\n      Admission $50.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Alebrijes Gala Production | Dia de los Muertos Atlantic Canada\n        \n                  \n            Admission $50 ||\nStep into the magical world of Alebrijes, where imagination comes to life through vibrant dance, music, visual art, and storytelling.\nInspired by the iconic creatures of Mexican folk art, this original multidisciplinary production celebrates creativity, cultural connection, and the power of imagination. Presented as part of the Dia d lose Muertos Atlantic Canada Festival, Alebrijes invites audiences of all ages on a colourful journey where tradition and fantasy come together in a joyful celebration of art, culture and community. \n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Dance      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Presentation      \n    \n          \n        Event Length: 90 minutes\n      \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/alebrijes-gala-production-dia-de-los-muertos-atlantic-canada/46801ACDBKCSKJDBSGRJBRPHCJBLCKVCG/#event-46801acdbkcskjdbsgrjbrphcjblckvcg\",\n    \"name\": \"Alebrijes Gala Production | Dia de los Muertos Atlantic Canada\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/alebrijes-gala-production-dia-de-los-muertos-atlantic-canada/46801ACDBKCSKJDBSGRJBRPHCJBLCKVCG/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Admission $50 || Step into the magical world of Alebrijes, where imagination comes to life through vibrant dance, music, visual art, and storytelling. Inspired by the iconic creatures of Mexican folk art, this original multidisciplinary production celebrates creativity, cultural connection, and the power of imagination. Presented as part of the Dia d lose Muertos Atlantic Canada Festival, Alebrijes invites audiences of all ages on a colourful journey where tradition and fantasy come together in a joyful celebration of art, culture and community.\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/85d28044-17cf-4396-a7a6-e669e7fa1f26.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01T13:00:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektr