    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Tue Nov 3, 2026 • 8:00pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Rock\n      \n\n\n      Admission $81.25 | Admission $66.25\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Raine Maida & Chantal Kreviazuk: I'm Going to Break Your Heart Tour\n        \n                  \n            \nRaine Maida & Chantal Kreviazuk\n I’m Going to Break Your Heart Tour\nWith a combined 30 nominations, 8 Juno awards a Grammy, Raine Maida (Our Lady Peace) and Chantal Kreviazuk have spent three decades shaping the sound of contemporary music both separately and together. Their partnership extends well past music. They have received multiple humanitarian awards for their work with Warchild and Mental Health and are Order of Canada recipients. As one of Canada’s most influential couples, Maida and Kreviazuk are stepping into a bold new chapter with includes a forthcoming double memoir due out August 5th, a new album together and an exciting fall tour. Their show defies usual concert experiences. Extraordinary musical performances alongside unscripted moments between songs that only a couple who have truly lived and created together could offer. It’s a night that moves you, surprises you and stays with you long after the lights comeVIP TICKETS\n\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Rock      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t  \t  \n    \tPerformer Website:\n    \t\n      Visit Website\n    \t\n      \n\t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/raine-maida-chantal-kreviazuk-im-going-to-break-your-heart-tour/30801ARPRRSKJDTQHHJTDRTPHSSSJNCJP/#event-30801arprrskjdtqhhjtdrtphsssjncjp\",\n    \"name\": \"Raine Maida & Chantal Kreviazuk: I'm Going to Break Your Heart Tour\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/raine-maida-chantal-kreviazuk-im-going-to-break-your-heart-tour/30801ARPRRSKJDTQHHJTDRTPHSSSJNCJP/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Advanced Orchestra $81.25 | Advanced Balcony $66.25 | Day of Show Orchestra $86.25 | Day of Show Balcony $71.25 With a combined 30 nominations, 8 Juno awards a Grammy, Raine Maida (Our Lady Peace) and Chantal Kreviazuk have spent three decades shaping the sound of contemporary music both separately and together. Their partnership extends well past music. They have received multiple humanitarian awards for their work with Warchild and Mental Health and are Order of Canada recipients. As one of Canada’s most influential couples, Maida and Kreviazuk are stepping into a bold new chapter with includes a forthcoming double memoir due out August 5th, a new album together and an exciting fall tour. Their show defies usual concert experiences. Extraordinary musical performances alongside unscripted moments between songs that only a couple who have truly lived and created together could offer. It’s a night that moves you, surprises you and stays with you long after the lights come up\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/db28da8b-2f96-47ad-bf81-0dea20145aed.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-11-03T16:00:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=30801ARPRRSKJDTQHHJTDRTPHSSSJNCJP\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2026-11-03T16:00:00-04:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Raine Maida & Chantal Kreviazuk: I'm Going to Break Your Heart Tour\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
