        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Thu Nov 12, 2026 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Classical / Orchestra\n      \n\n\n      Adult $49.00 | Student $20.00 | Arts Workers/Indigenous Community $25.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  SNB: HeartStrings\n        \n                  \n            Call Box Office for Subscription\nRegular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245\nAccredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125\nStudent: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100 \nYouth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission\nAn evening that illuminates the many shapes of love — from yearning and destiny to\ntenderness and rediscovery.\nUne soirée qui explore les multiples visages de l’amour : du désir et de la destinée à la\ntendresse et aux retrouvailles.\nConductor: Mélanie Léonard\nGuest artist: Danielle Sametz, violin\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Classical / Orchestra      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snb-heartstrings/47601ALRPQQGLMRHLJRSGRRTJGJKMNSGT/#event-47601alrpqqglmrhljrsgrrtjgjkmnsgt\",\n    \"name\": \"SNB: HeartStrings\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/snb-heartstrings/47601ALRPQQGLMRHLJRSGRRTJGJKMNSGT/\",\n    \"ev