        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tales of a Charlie Brown Christmas Trio"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "$40 Regular || $35 member || Tales of a Charlie Brown Christmas is a live concert show featuring the jazz trio of the late Jerry Granelli—the last surviving member of the original Vince Guaraldi Trio that recorded the 1965 soundtrack. The show shares behind-the-scenes stories of recording the classic soundtrack, often featuring drummer Jerry Granelli (and later, JA Granelli) performing the music alongside visuals."
      }
    ],
