        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Fri Nov 20, 2026 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Jazz\n      \n\n  Event length: 90 minutes\n\n      Admission $40.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n      \n      IT Member Event\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Tales of a Charlie Brown Christmas Trio\n        \n                  \n            $40 Regular || $35 member ||\nTales of a Charlie Brown Christmas is a live concert show featuring the jazz trio of the late Jerry Granelli—the last surviving member of the original Vince Guaraldi Trio that recorded the 1965 soundtrack. The show shares behind-the-scenes stories of recording the classic soundtrack, often featuring drummer Jerry Granelli (and later, JA Granelli) performing the music alongside visuals.\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Jazz      \n    \n          \n        Event Length: 90 minutes\n      \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n      \n        \n          \n        Season Sponsor\n              \n    \n    \n      \n      \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/tales-of-a-charlie-brown-christmas-trio/38401ANGTJSBMBHBQLHQPNRBLQSPPBRDN/#event-38401angtjsbmbhbqlhqpnrblqsppbrdn\",\n    \"name\": \"Tales of a Charlie Brown Christmas Trio\",\n    \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/event/tales-of-a-charlie-brown-christmas-trio/38401ANGTJSBMBHBQLHQPNRBLQSPPBRDN/\",\n    \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\n    \"eventStatus\": \"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\n    \"location\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n            \"http://kg.artsdata.ca/resource/K11-193\",\n            \"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3527482\"\n        ],\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"12 King Square South\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Saint John\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"E2L 5B8\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"New Brunswick\",\n            \"addressCountry\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Country\",\n                \"name\": \"CA\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"organizer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Imperial Theatre\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatre.ca/\"\n    },\n    \"description\": \"$40 Regular || $35 member || Tales of a Charlie Brown Christmas is a live concert show featuring the jazz trio of the late Jerry Granelli—the last surviving member of the original Vince Guaraldi Trio that recorded the 1965 soundtrack. The show shares behind-the-scenes stories of recording the classic soundtrack, often featuring drummer Jerry Granelli (and later, JA Granelli) performing the music alongside visuals.\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/8a4d065d-7f58-4a3b-ac41-62b7505f3981.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-11-20T15:30:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=38401ANGTJSBMBHBQLHQPNRBLQSPPBRDN\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2026-11-20T15:30:00-04:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Tales of a Charlie Brown Christmas Trio\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
