 Christian Ludwig Hansen, lighting by Jessica Lewis, costumes, set and props by Leesa Hamilton, and directed by Ben Stone, “Final Recordings...” is where TED Talk, sob story, and cottagecore collide. CREDITS Ben Stone - director Stewart Legere - performer Ben Stone and Stewart Legere - playwrights Fundy Geological Museum, Regan Maloney - science consultant Stewart Legere - composer Christian Ludwig Hansen - projection design Stewart Legere - sound design Jess Lewis - lighting design Leesa Hamilton - costume, prop and set design Bernie Francis - Mi'kmaw language consultant Sophie Schade - producer Mary Fay Coady - interim producer Gaby Milner - FSPA student apprentice\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/da1d1a13-0b82-4d3c-b956-c5e969c5ac87.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-01-16T15:30:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=38801AQDNRKLTDJNRGTHNNSDTQVMLRTCD\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-16T15:30:00-04:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Zuppa: The Final Recordings of an Almost Extinct Bird\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
