        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Fri Feb 19, 2027 • 5:00pm\n\n  \n          Other\n    \n          Presentation\n      \n\n  Event length: 180 minutes\n\n      Admission $65.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  Faces of Fusion\n        \n                  \n            $55 Early Bird || $65 Regular Price ||\nFaces of Fusion is back – and we want you to be a part of it.\nA social gathering with a purpose, Faces of Fusion is where professional networking and community\ncelebration meet. This signature annual event, hosted by Fusion Saint John, shines a spotlight on\nthe individuals, organizations, and businesses helping to move the Saint John region forward.\nEach year, Faces of Fusion brings together an inspiring mix of changemakers: newcomers driving\ninnovation, lifelong residents building stronger communities, and leaders lifting up the next\ngeneration. It’s a powerful celebration of progress, passion, and the people who make our city a\nbetter place to live.\nFor 25 years, Fusion Saint John has been committed to creating spaces for connection, collaboration,\nand opportunity. As a volunteer-led non-profit, our mission is to build a stronger, more inclusive Saint\nJohn by helping people feel welcomed, inspired, and engaged in shaping our shared future.\nThroughout the year, we host meetups, workshops, and networking events that bring people\ntogether — but Faces of Fusion is our marquee event. It’s a night of recognition and connection that\nhighlights the heart and soul of this city. \nLet’s celebrate what makes this city exceptional — together. Join us February 19th for Faces of Fusion 2027!\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n  