        "@value": "$45 Regular || $40 Member || $25 Youth || $110 Family || Fun, family circus from local fav Flip Fabrique! Catch-me is a dynamic and spectacular show that revisits the founding production of the company, created for its 15th anniversary. A true celebration of play and childhood nostalgia, it blends acrobatics, juggling, and balance within a relaxed visual and sound universe. Six friends reunite after ten years apart. Summer is coming to an end, and during this gathering at a cottage, they rediscover their little paradise and rekindle their bond. The desire to play and put on a show returns, along with the energy of childhood, filled with teasing and laughter. This return to the past, marked by acrobatics, juggling, and playful moments, captures the nostalgia and joy of these reunions. By the end of the weekend, their paths will separate once again, but this unforgettable reunion remains etched in their hearts."
      }
    ],
