r is coming to an end, and during this gathering at a cottage, they rediscover their little paradise and rekindle their bond. The desire to play and put on a show returns, along with the energy of childhood, filled with teasing and laughter. This return to the past, marked by acrobatics, juggling, and playful moments, captures the nostalgia and joy of these reunions. By the end of the weekend, their paths will separate once again, but this unforgettable reunion remains etched in their hearts.\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/27d23748-3e7a-4fe1-b42b-44f872404370.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-02-20T15:30:00-04:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=40201AJMHGMLBHTGVNKHNPGVSVHHPSMBQ\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-02-20T15:30:00-04:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Catch Me!\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t"
