    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "$35 Adult || $30 Member || $20 Youth || Family $100 \"Là-bas is a clown show produced by L'Aubergine, featuring a trio of inseparable friends on a journey toward a better future. The production centers on themes of mutual aid, solidarity, and fraternal friendship, portrayed through the characters' comical and wacky adventures.Production Team and Creatives Director & Original Idea: Véronika Makdissi-Warren Assistant Director: Mélissa Bouchard Performers: Miguel Fontaine, Amélie Gadbois, and Jocelyn Paré Set Design and Lighting: Christian Fontaine Costumes: Julie Morel Music: Stéphane Caron\""
      }
