    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SNB: Verdi Requiem"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Call Box Office for Subscription | Regular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245 Accredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125 Student: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100  Youth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission Thunderous, tender, and fiercely majestic, Verdi’s Requiem reunites Symphony NB and Choeur Louisbourg for a triumphant collaboration of epic proportions. Tour à tour foudroyant, bouleversant et majestueux, le Requiem de Verdi réunit à nouveau Symphonie Nouveau-Brunswick et le Chœur Louisbourg pour une collaboration d’une ampleur exceptionnelle. Conductor: Mélanie Léonard Guest artists: Choeur Louisbourg (Monique Richard, Artistic Director) Elisabeth St-Gelais, soprano | Christianne Bélanger, mezzo-soprano Ernesto Ramirez, tenor | Alex Halliday, bass Program G Verdi: Messa da Requiem (1874)"
      }
    ],
