        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Tue Mar 9, 2027 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Classical / Orchestra\n      \n\n\n      Adult $49.00 | Student $20.00 | Arts Workers/Indigenous Community $25.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  SNB: Verdi Requiem\n        \n                  \n            Call Box Office for Subscription |\nRegular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245\nAccredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125\nStudent: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100 \nYouth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission\nThunderous, tender, and fiercely majestic, Verdi’s Requiem reunites Symphony NB and\nChoeur Louisbourg for a triumphant collaboration of epic proportions.\nTour à tour foudroyant, bouleversant et majestueux, le Requiem de Verdi réunit à\nnouveau Symphonie Nouveau-Brunswick et le Chœur Louisbourg pour une\ncollaboration d’une ampleur exceptionnelle.\nConductor: Mélanie Léonard\nGuest artists: Choeur Louisbourg (Monique Richard, Artistic Director)\nElisabeth St-Gelais, soprano | Christianne Bélanger, mezzo-soprano\nErnesto Ramirez, tenor | Alex Halliday, bass\nProgram\nG Verdi: Messa da Requiem (1874)\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Classical / Orchestra      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": 