lls with writers to craft his unique comedic voice. Since then, Brian’s comedy career has taken off, with sold-out shows across the world. At seventy years old Brian is ready to embark on his \\\"ONE LAST TIME\\\" Tour which brings audiences a mix of hilarious one-liners and a deeply personal, comedic look at his experiences with family, hockey, and life. You don't want to miss the opportunity to see one of professional hockey's most engaging personalities share his hilarious LIFE experiences on stage.\",\n    \"image\": [\n        \"https://system.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/files/343bd15f-a5ae-4e5c-a8fd-d38b8dba17e5.jpg\"\n    ],\n    \"startDate\": \"2027-04-24T17:00:00-03:00\",\n    \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"url\": \"https://imperialtheatrenewbrunswick.spektrix.com/imperialtheatrenewbrunswick/website/EventDetails.aspx?EventId=49401ADNVSTHMKTMHNKQJBMSHCJRPSGNV\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"validFrom\": \"2027-04-24T17:00:00-03:00\"\n    },\n    \"performer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"additionalType\": [\n            \"http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Agent\",\n            \"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent\"\n        ],\n        \"name\": \"Club Rewind: Brian Patafie\"\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t"
