        "@value": "Call Box Office for Subscription | Regular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245 Accredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125 Student: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100  Youth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission Renowned violinist Lara St. John takes centre stage for Mendelssohn’s dramatic violin concerto, framed by Beethoven's commanding energy and Mayer's trailblazing voice. La célèbre violoniste Lara St. John est à l’honneur dans le saisissant Concerto pour violon de Mendelssohn, au cœur d’un programme porté par l’énergie souveraine de Beethoven et l’écriture audacieuse de Mayer. Conductor: Mélanie Léonard Guest artist: Lara St. John, violin Program L v Beethoven: Coriolan Overture Op.62 (1807) F Mendelssohn: Violin Concerto Op.64 (1844) E Mayer: Symphony No.1 (1847)"
