        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    Wed May 12, 2027 • 7:30pm\n\n  \n          Music\n    \n          Classical / Orchestra\n      \n\n\n      Adult $49.00 | Student $20.00 | Arts Workers/Indigenous Community $25.00\n    \n      Ticket prices include all taxes and fees.\n    \n  \n\n\n      \n  \n    Buy tickets\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t  \n    \n      \n                  SNB: Character in Motion\n        \n                  \n            Call Box Office for Subscription |\nRegular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245\nAccredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125\nStudent: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100 \nYouth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission\nRenowned violinist Lara St. John takes centre stage for Mendelssohn’s dramatic violin\nconcerto, framed by Beethoven's commanding energy and Mayer's trailblazing voice.\nLa célèbre violoniste Lara St. John est à l’honneur dans le saisissant Concerto pour\nviolon de Mendelssohn, au cœur d’un programme porté par l’énergie souveraine de\nBeethoven et l’écriture audacieuse de Mayer.\nConductor: Mélanie Léonard\nGuest artist: Lara St. John, violin\nProgram\nL v Beethoven: Coriolan Overture Op.62 (1807)\nF Mendelssohn: Violin Concerto Op.64 (1844)\nE Mayer: Symphony No.1 (1847)\n          \n        \n              \n\n      \n  \n    Event Info\n\n          \n        Category: Music      \n    \n          \n        Genre: Classical / Orchestra      \n    \n    \n      \n  \n  \t\t\n\n\n      \n      Venue\n\n              Imperial Theatre\n      \n              12 King Square South, Saint John NB, E2L 5B8\n      \n              \n          \n            View on Google Maps\n          \n        \n          \n  \n  \n\n\n\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Event\",\n    \"@id