    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Melly Dunn Ultimate 80's Experience"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Orchestra Admission $55 || Balcony Admission $50 || Dust off your neon and leathers! Pull up your leg warmers. Get ready to relive the cult decade that screams nostalgia! Melly Dunn’s Ultimate 80’s brings you a world-class, high-energy experience packed with the biggest hits of the 1980’s. It’s a time machine featuring a powerhouse lead vocalist backed by a razor-sharp band. This show unleashes the signature sounds of Bonnie Tyler, ABBA, Michael Jackson, Eurythmics, Journey, Pat Benatar, Blondie, Madonna, Bon Jovi and many more. With jaw-dropping vocal range, authentic 80’s attire, killer guitar solos, and non-stop energy, this nostalgic tribute guarantees a night you won’t forget. Tune up your vocal cords, because we wanna hear you singing and reminiscing like no one’s watching. Big voices. Iconic hits. One legendary night."
      }
    ],
