    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Call Box Office for Subscription | Regular: $49/concert  |  6-concert subscription: $245 Accredited NB Professional Artist: $25/concert | 6-concert subscription: $125 Student: $20/concert  |  6-concert subscription:  $100  Youth/Child 12 and under: Free Admission A season closer of radiant colour, weaving Shakespearean magic, heavenly lyricism, and Mussorgsky’s evocative Pictures at an Exhibition. Pour clore la saison en couleurs, un programme où s’entrelacent la magie shakespearienne, un lyrisme céleste et les évocateurs Tableaux d’une exposition de Moussorgski. Conductor: Mélanie Léonard Guest artist: Camryn Dewar, soprano Program F Mendelssohn: Overture \"A Midsummer Nights Dream\" Op. 21 (1826) I Cusson: Le Récital des anges M Mussorgsky: Pictures at an Exhibition (1874)"
